{"_id":"fRjlubdA4P3eHbs1","name":"Agitator","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You spend our time rousing the rabble, giving speeches for your cause, or for the cause of whoever is paying you the most! That Ork riot in the Redwood Barrens last month, some say that was caused by you.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Light Pistol, Armour Vest, seditious holo-chips</p><p><strong>What is your cause? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Anarchist. End the tyranny!</li>\n<li>Eco-terrorist. Down with technology!</li>\n<li>Money. Who cares, as long as I get paid.</li>\n<li>Populist. Power to the people!</li>\n<li>Fame. Causes come and go. Outrage is currency.</li>\n<li>Retired. You used to care about something…</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What is your most recent exploit? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>A soy-riot in the Greenstone Barrens.</li>\n<li>A worker walk-out of the Sempai cyberworks factory.</li>\n<li>False flag corporate gunfight</li>\n<li>Firebombing of LowMoon PD headquarters</li>\n<li>Highway protest for Ork Rights!</li>\n<li>Happy-Happy-Joy-Fun Noodle shop boycott</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Zv58F7cHpAaLVnAV","name":"Bodyguard","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Lots of people need protection in the Blocks. The best clients pick the professional types that keep their mouth shut. That’s you. You can fight when you have to but it's much better to spot the trouble before it sees you and make a quick exit.</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Heavy Pistol, lined coat, aviator sunglasses</p><p><strong>Who have you protected? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Executive of the Mars Corporation.</li>\n<li>Sim-sense adult actress Laila Lovelace.</li>\n<li>Crime-boss Cappacolla</li>\n<li>Eastern Diplomat from the Mazza clan.</li>\n<li>A Corp. spy, codename: “Stiff Whiskers”</li>\n<li>Elvish aristocrat from over the sea.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>A secret you know about them? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Actually a supernatural entity.</li>\n<li>They don’t exist, it's a hoax.</li>\n<li>They are into some illegal personal activities.</li>\n<li>They are being blackmailed by a corp.</li>\n<li>They committed a horrible crime you helped cover up.</li>\n<li>They once visited a Dragon.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"ig0ridci3u0byHU4","name":"Combat Mage","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Whether corporate security, law enforcement or the military, when the magical drek hits the fan, you are the guy they call. Staying alive and wreaking havoc on the magical battlefield is what you do. Why you decided to leave that high paying gig to shift in the shadows is your business.</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Spell Focus (1), Armour Clothing, Digital Grimoire</p><p><strong>Where did you learn your skills? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>A corporation.</li>\n<li>Fancy Magic academy.</li>\n<li>Private magical combat dojo.</li>\n<li>Self-taught.</li>\n<li>Law enforcement.</li>\n<li>Special Government Operations.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What drives you today? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>You’re a magical gunslinger. Who is the best?</li>\n<li>Power. Raw power.</li>\n<li>Revenge on a supernatural entity.</li>\n<li>Money, like everyone else.</li>\n<li>Justice. Somebody has to be for it.</li>\n<li>Boredom. You have a fireball spell, it needs to be used!</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"bXb2H0ENtaSc97DM","name":"Decker","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Sliding through the matrix, jacking in where others don’t want you, stealing data and leaving not a trace…or your calling card. You are expert at running the matrix both the legal side, and the dark net.</p><p>Etiquette: Matrix</p><p>Equipment: Cyberdeck (2), Light Pistol, Funky hair</p><p><strong>Why do you run the Matrix? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The thrill of it.</li>\n<li>To get revenge on a corporation</li>\n<li>A mysterious AI named “Swanson” guides you.</li>\n<li>Money, chummer!</li>\n<li>You have a bizarre and specific Data fetish.</li>\n<li>Reputation.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What secrets have you uncovered in the Matrix? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Bank account and PIN of a local politico.</li>\n<li>The Yakuza crime boss has a secret half-gaijin daughter.</li>\n<li>A powerful local-Mage has been getting bribed by Dragon.</li>\n<li>The plans for the new Mars handgun, called the Commando.</li>\n<li>The routes and codes for the next month of the city garbage drones.</li>\n<li>A backdoor to the city hall HR application.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Matrix"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"OgjeZW1RPpJVhIJS","name":"Detective","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Wherever you learned your skills, you now use them to solve problems for the folks the corporations forgot. Turns out those skills are super useful for shadow surfing as well!</p><p>Etiquette: Street, Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Lined Coat, Cheap Revolver, half-smoked cigar</p><p><strong>What was your biggest case? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The Pensacola strangler.</li>\n<li>Poisoning of Pizza, Pizza, Pizza sauce vats.</li>\n<li>Murder of a local sim-sense star.</li>\n<li>Theft of data codes from Sempai corporation.</li>\n<li>Theft of sacred stones from the native heritage museum.</li>\n<li>Breaking up the Vegan eco-terrorist cell in Hobbs park.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Why are you freelance now? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Corruption of the establishment.</li>\n<li>More money in it this way Chummer.</li>\n<li>Freedom, you don’t like being told how to do your job.</li>\n<li>Somebody has to help the bottom of society.</li>\n<li>You like to work alone.</li>\n<li>You got kicked out for giving a darn when it wasn’t your turn to give a darn.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":400,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"mDv7oSp5ElL9vRV6","name":"Dilettante","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are part of the pajama-class. For whatever reason you never had to work. Either wealthy parents, sugar-person or just didn’t care. You moved in the polite and proper circles of society though, and picked up the skills necessary in that world.</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate and Media</p><p>Equipment: Fancy clothes, Light Pistol, Dress sword, Extra [[/roll 1d6]] Wealth, Trust fund.</p><p><strong>How did you get your money? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The old fashioned way, inherited it!</li>\n<li>One shady deal then you walked away.</li>\n<li>Gray market dealings in human organs.</li>\n<li>Bribery.</li>\n<li>Somebody really, really likes you. Who?</li>\n<li>Bank error in your favor.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What is your current obsession? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Elf fashion.</li>\n<li>Dwarf cuisine.</li>\n<li>Sin-sense RPG streaming.</li>\n<li>Soy-vat ASMLR.</li>\n<li>Fast motorcycles.</li>\n<li>Shaman-led Fungtea rituals.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":500,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"8T9Lg5yazteWVU67","name":"Entertainer","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Bassist for a synth-rock back that plays in trendy clubs uptown or drummer for an Ork thrash-metal ska fusion trio in the Barrens, music and entertaining is your passion. These days, lots of people in the music business are into some shady stuff as well and you fell into using your gifts to make some extra nu-Yuan on the side.</p><p>Etiquette: Media</p><p>Equipment: Musical Instrument, Derringer, Datapad with all your lyrics</p><p><strong>Who have you entertained? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Mafia crime boss’ daughter’s 15th birthday.</li>\n<li>Local political rally.</li>\n<li>The masses!</li>\n<li>Military Recruitment tour.</li>\n<li>Local Fixer who has jobs.</li>\n<li>No one. You’re too shy.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What have you learned? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The LowMoon cops love synth-jam bands.</li>\n<li>Corporate types don’t appreciate your brand of thrash metal.</li>\n<li>Orks get rowdy on payday.</li>\n<li>The secret back entrance to one of the major local venues.</li>\n<li>The police chief has a secret lover.</li>\n<li>The owner of a local club deals in black market data on the side.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Media"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"bgj673nDRvMrHnrK","name":"Former Corp. Security","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You used to work security for a corporation or law enforcement agency. Not anymore though, you left or got bounced. Now you use your former colleagues and skills to make your money kicking ass.</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Partial Riot Suit, Light SMG, Stun Baton</p><p><strong>Where did you used to work? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Mars Corporation.</li>\n<li>Sempai Corporation.</li>\n<li>Federated Amalgam Concerns.</li>\n<li>Matsumura Fishworks and Tamaribuchi Heavy Manufacturing Concern.</li>\n<li>IncaTel Macrotechnology.</li>\n<li>Sudoku Corporation.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Why did you leave? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Budgetary cutbacks.</li>\n<li>You saw a boss doing the dirty.</li>\n<li>You quit over mass corruption.</li>\n<li>Your old boss didn’t like you.</li>\n<li>You left for more money but that job fell through.</li>\n<li>It’s a long story that you are constantly trying to tell…</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"nBkvBN6fUIvIionA","name":"Former Salaryman","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>A middle manager for one of the corps was a sweet life. You left it for some reason, or got tossed for dipping into the wrong data file or secretarial pool. Now you are reduced to making your nu-Yen in the shadows, and you aren’t particularly cut out for it either…</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Cyberdeck (1), Datapad with some random valuable corporate data</p><p><strong>Where did you used to work? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Mars Corporation.</li>\n<li>Sempai Corporation.</li>\n<li>Federated Amalgam Concerns.</li>\n<li>Matsumura Fishworks and Tamaribuchi Heavy Manufacturing Concern.</li>\n<li>IncaTel Macrotechnology.</li>\n<li>Sudoku Corporation.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Why did you leave? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Budgetary cutbacks.</li>\n<li>You saw a boss doing the dirty.</li>\n<li>You quit over mass corruption.</li>\n<li>Your old boss didn’t like you.</li>\n<li>You left for more money but that job fell through.</li>\n<li>It’s a long story that you are constantly trying to tell…</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":800,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"eYc0qqCkpNAXe2bA","name":"Ganger","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are part of, or grew up in, a gang. There are dozens and dozens in the city, all fighting for the scraps that trickle down from the corporations.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Colors or Cut, Melee weapon of choice</p><p><strong>Who do/did you roll with? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The Skeletors</li>\n<li>The Wastrels</li>\n<li>The Vegan Punchers</li>\n<li>Hell’s Satans</li>\n<li>The Hexen</li>\n<li>Surly Sevens</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Who are you beefing with? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The Skeletors</li>\n<li>The Wastrels</li>\n<li>The Vegan Punchers</li>\n<li>Hell’s Satans</li>\n<li>The Hexen</li>\n<li>Surly Sevens</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":900,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"FghuJEEghPmwHJIO","name":"Gambler","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>There ain’t no straight way to make it out of the Barrens. If there was, people would do it. Lie, cheat, steal and bluff is your only shot. Just hope you don’t cross someone bad enough to end you before you rake the big pot.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Derringer, Marked deck of holo-cards, A stack of creds to get you into the big game (extra [[/roll 1d6]] WP).</p><p><strong>Who’d you take for a big pot recently? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Yakuza hitman.</li>\n<li>Local PD Captain.</li>\n<li>A politician's kid.</li>\n<li>A Street Shaman</li>\n<li>Teddy GRU</li>\n<li>Everybody at Forget’s, you can’t go back there…</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Who wants revenge? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Same person as above.</li>\n<li>A low-talent street kid gunning for your spot</li>\n<li>Your family.</li>\n<li>Your jilted lover, Brenda(n).</li>\n<li>Johnny Seidel, 2 time world poker champion.</li>\n<li>You do. On the world!</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1000,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"4mrvjhRUBnbnNr9X","name":"Mage Detective","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You combine your newfound magical abilities with old fashion gumshoe tradecraft to help folks who need a little supernatural investigation. This tends to be pretty dangerous…but lucrative!</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Lined Coat, Fedora, Spirit Fetish Specific (2)</p><p><strong>Why are you a freelancer now? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Somebody has to help those in need.</li>\n<li>They kicked you off the force for telling the truth!</li>\n<li>Better money in the private sector.</li>\n<li>You like operating in gray areas.</li>\n<li>You just weren’t good enough…or so they said…</li>\n<li>You were meant for so much more.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What keeps you up at night? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Your past failures.</li>\n<li>The loss of a loved one you couldn’t prevent.</li>\n<li>The plight of the underclass.</li>\n<li>Vampires.</li>\n<li>Mummies.</li>\n<li>The Holy Ghost.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"ENh0X1enlmgDjsu4","name":"Physical Adept","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are one of the very, very few magical practitioners that manifest your power through physical development. Your body has capabilities far beyond human norms, whether through amazing feats of athletics, mastery of combat, or speed and strength.</p><p>Etiquette: Street or Corporate</p><p>Equipment: *Physical Adepts spend Athletics similar to Cybertechnology (see p. 148) Melee Weapon of choice, cool headband</p><p><strong>What is your goal? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Become the best swordsman who ever lived!</li>\n<li>Achieve Nirvana.</li>\n<li>Develop your own discipline and found a school.</li>\n<li>Use your gifts for personal renown.</li>\n<li>Use your gifts for others.</li>\n<li>Travel the land and have adventures.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What stands in your way? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Nothing!</li>\n<li>The Black Lotus clan.</li>\n<li>Your own imposter syndrome.</li>\n<li>Lack of ambition sometimes.</li>\n<li>The corp that drove your mother to an early grave!</li>\n<li>Master Hung Lo, Patriarch of the Bird Talon school.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"e6P4OdmxUV9jHRXv","name":"Mechanic","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You can work on just about anything. Down here in the shadows, this usually means jury-rigging and duct tape. You’re an asset to any team keeping weapons repaired, vehicles running and shutting down the odd power grid.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Tire Iron (club), Pump Shotgun, Datapad with a random schematic</p><p><strong>What is your favorite thing to work on? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>People!</li>\n<li>‘67 Bevy with dual cam overheads and aluminum wingnuts</li>\n<li>Bikes, any kind of bike.</li>\n<li>Guns.</li>\n<li>Your mental health.</li>\n<li>Cyber tech.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What is your next big equipment purchase going to be? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>A Harley Armadillo.</li>\n<li>Any military grade weapon you can get your hands on.</li>\n<li>A cyber upgrade for yourself. You’ve earned it!</li>\n<li>Stealth Tech</li>\n<li>An encrypted comms system for the team.</li>\n<li>A van with a red racing stripe.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"NNaMfFOHGBxFwOOR","name":"Medic","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Plenty of chummers to patch up and you got the training, somehow, to do it. A highly sought after companion on any run.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: 4 Slap patches, Light Pistol, Armoured Vest</p><p><strong>Why did you become a medic? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>To help people.</li>\n<li>Pays better than an office job.</li>\n<li>When you have your hands IN another creature… *shudder*...</li>\n<li>To repay society.</li>\n<li>You were saved by medical professionals when you were younger.</li>\n<li>Just a stepping stone on the path to greater things.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>How do you relieve the stress? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>I’ve got a bag full of drugs man, how do you think?</li>\n<li>Meditation.</li>\n<li>I take it out on those around me.</li>\n<li>I bottle it up until it explodes.</li>\n<li>I volunteer at a soup kitchen.</li>\n<li>I don’t have stress. I’m a God.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1400,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"OL0J0YHMMDTcOvND","name":"Nature Shaman","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Your people have returned to their roots and you are a guardian of their traditions. Why you have ventured into the urban decay of the Blocks is your own business, and likely a sad tale. Regardless, now you are here and pursuing your own ends.</p><p>Etiquette: Tribal Etiquette: Spirit Fetish (2), Melee or Primitive Weapon, Tribal clothes</p><p>Equipment: </p><p><strong>What spirits do you identify with the most? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Ancestral Tribal spirits.</li>\n<li>Forest Spirits</li>\n<li>Sky Spirits.</li>\n<li>Sun Spirits.</li>\n<li>Animal Totems.</li>\n<li>The Trickster.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Why are you in The Blocks? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Sent on a vision quest.</li>\n<li>Banished from the tribe for your views.</li>\n<li>To seek wisdom from City Shamans.</li>\n<li>To find a lost tribe member.</li>\n<li>Your tribe was destroyed.</li>\n<li>For Revenge!</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Tribal"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1500,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"kaCFlP5tqmXc3p8o","name":"Gearhead","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are one with your machine. Jacking directly into the vehicle for maximum effectiveness.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Motorcycle, Light SMG, Lined Coat</p><p><strong>Why do you prefer to drive or fly? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Too afraid to fight.</li>\n<li>Love connecting to machines more than people.</li>\n<li>Vehicles are real man, not like the Matrix.</li>\n<li>Just a gearhead I suppose…</li>\n<li>Because when it goes bad I hold the fate of everyone in my hands…it’s intoxicating.</li>\n<li>I’m just good like that. What is the best piece of driving or flying you’ve ever</li>\n</ol><p><strong>done? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Outrun an entire sector of LowMoon security.</li>\n<li>Won the Barrens 250 street Ancestry.</li>\n<li>Parallel parked on the first try in downtown Blocks during rush hour.</li>\n<li>Beat your nemesis, Handspan Hank, in a drag Ancestry.</li>\n<li>Made the Kessel run in less than 12 Parsecs.</li>\n<li>Inverted over a NjH Fighter Jet.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1600,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"HkijHxIkM411ejJ3","name":"Scrounger","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You see the streets like your own reflection. Dirty and ugly. Whether looking for a new Mr. Johnson or finding the right fence for the ivory mustache comb you lifted on that last job, you are the man to go to.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Light Pistol, 2 Fake SIN kits, Extra Contact</p><p><strong>Who is your go-to contact? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Boss Finch, local political street club.</li>\n<li>Spike, underboss of The Mohawks.</li>\n<li>Rufut Swole, Owner of a bar runners hang out called The Cashed Inn.</li>\n<li>Mr. Jansen, he always has a job you can play middle man for.</li>\n<li>PNj 547i-a8H42 - a Matrix address you found on a bar napkin. Has high end jobs from time to time.</li>\n<li>PR Director at IncaTel Macrotechnology.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What’s the best place to find black market cyber gear? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Sal’s Cyber Slop Bucket.</li>\n<li>Dans Mackerel, has a shop in the Barrens.</li>\n<li>From the loading dock of Saipan enterprises.</li>\n<li>Ares Munitions secret bunker on the outskirts.</li>\n<li>A secret auction is held every third Sunday after the first Monday.</li>\n<li>Off the back of a truck.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1700,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"rrUqij2OtGNPz97v","name":"Soldier","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Plenty of job security for someone willing to carry a rifle and get shot at for somebody else's profit margin. Now you’re getting shot at for your own profit.</p><p>Etiquette: Corporate</p><p>Equipment: Battle Rifle, 2 Grenades, Dogtags</p><p><strong>What’s the worst fight you’ve been involved in? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>MexoAmerican alliance jungle wars.</li>\n<li>Street fight in the Greenstone Barrens.</li>\n<li>That’s classified.</li>\n<li>Euro-American wars, invasion of Seville.</li>\n<li>Arctic shelf oil wars.</li>\n<li>Dakota rebellion of aught-six.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Everybody has an old Army buddy, who’s yours? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>They didn’t make it.</li>\n<li>Sgt. Merry. Don’t let the name fool ya.</li>\n<li>Lieutenant Stan. He lost his arms.</li>\n<li>Private Egsell. What a screw up…</li>\n<li>Corporal Thaddeus. Man, he’s got some crazy opinions.</li>\n<li>Captain Hannibal. Finest leader of men I’ve ever known.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Corporate"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1800,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"Mzk8DhXNTWqMolLv","name":"Street Mage","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You ain’t no high falutin’ wizard from a big school or fancy academy. You learned your art on the street. Quick, dirty and effective. Sometimes the best spell is the one you don’t have to cast. Seeing around corners, both physical and magical, is your specialty.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Power Focus (1), Lined Coat, Walking cane</p><p><strong>Why the Streets? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>That is where the real drek goes down.</li>\n<li>Corps and Academies are too stuffy. I like to wing it.</li>\n<li>The street is where the real power brokers are.</li>\n<li>No place else would have me.</li>\n<li>I got kicked out of school for turning the Dean into a newt. He got better.</li>\n<li>They don’t teach the Dark Arts anywhere else, chummer.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What has magic taught you? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Spell casters are just plain better than everyone else.</li>\n<li>Not much, just a skill like any other I suppose.</li>\n<li>Magic ain’t everything. You need to work as a team.</li>\n<li>It’s very dangerous, but the power is exhilarating.</li>\n<li>Love me, Hate me…or Fear me. I don’t care which.</li>\n<li>I wish I didn’t have all this power. I feel so responsible.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1900,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"b8n3C8Mt6ODFw06F","name":"Street Shaman","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>There are spirits in the city too. Rats, Gators, and the corruption of the human masses themselves can all be harnessed by those who know. You master the spirits that know the Barrens and the Sewers.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Spirit Focus (1), Pump Shotgun</p><p><strong>What is your totem? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Rat</li>\n<li>Snake</li>\n<li>Gator</li>\n<li>Dog</li>\n<li>Cat</li>\n<li>The City itself!</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What secrets do the Streets reveal to you? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>There is a river of slime flowing through the sewers, and it’s growing!</li>\n<li>Ratmen are real. I’ve seen them. Nobody will l isten to me.</li>\n<li>Toxic shamans have been seen in the Greenstone Barrens.</li>\n<li>The Mars corporation is purposely poisoning the city water supply.</li>\n<li>The best Noodle Bar is the Yum-Sum on Hofmann Street.</li>\n<li>There is a great spirit war going on between city spirits and nature spirits. Gods help us if it ever spills over into our world!</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2000,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"iOXSxsycFDdOwfNR","name":"Street Warrior","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are razored up and ready to rock. You fight on the streets, nuff said. Better nobody ask you to talk to anyone or sneak around a corner.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Katana, RoomBroom, muscles on muscles</p><p><strong>What is your favorite chrome shop? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>McAl’s in Midtown.</li>\n<li>I’m not telling you, chummer.</li>\n<li>I only trust Dragon Moon in Chinatown.</li>\n<li>The Swede. He’s a craftsman.</li>\n<li>Krazzy Kurt over in the Greenstone Barrens.</li>\n<li>I got a guy…</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Who have you gone up against? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The Mohawks Street Gang.</li>\n<li>Saipan Security.</li>\n<li>Trencher Thorpe, cybered up tough guy.</li>\n<li>Hugo Grotius, Tech Ronin, lost…</li>\n<li>The Sisters, I ran away!</li>\n<li>RazorGrl.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"BcbWdiiSJNdEHcp7","name":"Thief","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Good old fashioned burglary, sneaking and backstabbing. There isn’t as much use for picking locks as there used to be but not all problems can be solved with magic or a computer and you are there to get those jobs done.</p><p>Etiquette: Street</p><p>Equipment: Lockpick set, Knife, Light Pistol</p><p><strong>Who have you robbed? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Matsumura Fishworks and Tamaribuchi Heavy Manufacturing Concern</li>\n<li>The Yakuza!</li>\n<li>Sin-Sense manufacturer Pleasure Hive.</li>\n<li>Craig over at the Tolkien Trove rare books.</li>\n<li>Nobody.</li>\n<li>Mars Weapons and Ammo in the Greenstone Barrens.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Who wants you dead? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The local Mafia.</li>\n<li>Your family, what a disgrace!</li>\n<li>No one, I ain’t done nothin’</li>\n<li>Sam Walid, Street Shaman.</li>\n<li>The Mohawk Street Gang.</li>\n<li>LowMoon PD, you made them look stupid.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Street"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"bAB2yB8LAESxsOJt","name":"Tribesman","type":"Career","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Tribesmen have left their ancestral homes either by choice, wanderlust or due to some dark secret. Their stoic demeanor and specialized weapons are sometimes sought after in the city. Traveling outside the city for any reason is where they really shine, however.</p><p>Etiquette: Tribal</p><p>Equipment: Bow, Axe, Native Garb</p><p><strong>From whence do you hail? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>A tribe by the mountains.</li>\n<li>You were raised in the city in a medicine lodge.</li>\n<li>The boundless prairie.</li>\n<li>The Pueblo Mesa Republic.</li>\n<li>The frigid North.</li>\n<li>Far, far away. A stranger in a strange land.</li>\n</ol><p><strong>What have you learned in the Blocks? (roll a [[/roll 1d6]])</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The city is evil and corrupt.</li>\n<li>You like the city, so much to experience!</li>\n<li>To watch your back, and trust no one.</li>\n<li>Loners don’t last long. You need people to watch your back.</li>\n<li>The true name of a tree spirit in the park, “LaCario”.</li>\n<li>If you want to stay here, you better learn to use technology.</li>\n</ol>","isActive":false,"currentLevel":0,"activeSystem":"wetwired","etiquette":{"value":"Tribal"},"adventuringSkills":{"Appraise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Athletics":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Bargain":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Hardware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Computer Software":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Conjuring":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Bodyware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Cybertech: Headware":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Demolitions":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Disguise":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Dodge":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Drive":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Endurance":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Engineering":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Fly":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Gunnery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Heavy Armour":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Leadership":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Medicine":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Melee":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Persuasion":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Primitive Ranged":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12},"Small arms":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Sorcery":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Spot":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":10},"Stealth":{"isCareerSkill":false,"maximumLevel":0},"Survival":{"isCareerSkill":true,"maximumLevel":12}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":2300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
